* kokoro.cpp, pinned at a9e31430838c8bdc3d4beaaab62753681b9f7839:
  MIT, copyright the ggml authors and kokoro.cpp contributors.
* Google Highway, pinned at 2607d3b5b0113992fe84d3848859eae13b3b52c1:
